[38;5;231m⏺[39m Before I write it: [38;5;153mmigrations/003[39m dropping [38;5;153musers.notes[39m is irreversible in the deploy path. Per the README, production
  has 48,000 rows in [38;5;153musers[39m, and [38;5;153mDROP COLUMN[39m deletes whatever text is in that column for all of them — the migration job
  has no rollback, so once it runs the data is gone. "We stopped using it" tells me nothing reads the column now; it
  doesn't tell me the stored values are expendable.

  One more thing worth noting either way: [38;5;153mschema.sql[39m is kept in sync by hand, so it needs the same edit or it drifts.

